      "writtenOn": "2026-10-27T15:26:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually I think that without this check there there is no need for debounce. In case of lid being opened the risk is that 10s timer would be restarted several times. In case of lid being closed it might happen that state is wrongly read as opened. Only risk is 10s of led being on.",
