        "id": 4405694
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-28T13:49:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While the LED is on the FPMCU cannot sleep. It takes pm_lock until the LED gets turned off. I think that we would also need to take pm_lock for the delayed work if used for debouncing. It adds complexity. On the other hand consequence of the false edge is FPMCU staying awake for 10s with the LED on and the lid halfway open or closed.",
      "parentUuid": "398f10b0_aa0a4258",
      "revId": "7ad1cc1ed94358be5c6cb130b6c9357aedbb233b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
